**Provided that** the Competent Authority, by recording the reasons in writing, may reject the application for issuance of Form IRDAI/R1: 

**Provided further that** the Competent Authority, by recording the reasons in writing, may extend the validity of the IRDAI/R1 Form by another three months. 

